Package: cmf-dial
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-evdev, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, pulseaudio-utils, libnotify-bin, coreutils
Maintainer: Sree Ram M S <sreerammsofficial@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/Sree-Ram-MS/cmf-dial-linux
Description: Control Ubuntu with the CMF Buds Pro 2 case dial
 Turn the CMF Buds Pro 2 dial to scroll, change volume, flip slides,
 switch tabs and more. Presses switch modes or run any shortcut or command.
 Includes a settings app with a live tester.
 Inspired by Orbit by Yemcube (https://github.com/harsha20599/orbit).
